{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"停机问题"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"停机问题"},2]},"content":{"Plain":"\n<p>假设存在程序 $H$ 满足\n$$\r\nH(P,I) := \\begin{cases}\r\n    1 &amp; P(I) \\downarrow\\\\\r\n    0 &amp; P(I) \\uparrow.\r\n\\end{cases}\r\n$$</p>\n<p>构造程序 $H^+$, 满足对任意程序 $P$,\n$$\r\nH^+(P) \\downarrow \\quad\\Leftrightarrow\\quad P(P) \\uparrow.\r\n$$</p>\n<p>令 $P=H^+$, 则有\n$$\r\nH^+(H^+) \\downarrow\\,\\Leftrightarrow H^+(H^+) \\uparrow,\r\n$$\n矛盾.</p>\n"}}